---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import zicer from "../assets/images/zicer.jpg"
import TwitterIcon from "../icons/TwitterIcon.astro"
import Video from "../components/Video.astro"
---

<MainLayout>
<div class="sm:px-8 mt-16 sm:mt-32">
	<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl lg:px-8">
		<div class="relative px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-5xl">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-y-12">
					<div class="lg:pl-20">
						<div class="max-w-xs px-2.5 lg:max-w-none">
							<Image style="color: transparent;" src={zicer} alt="gabriel avatar" width="800" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 32rem, 20rem" class="aspect-square rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 object-cover dark:bg-zinc-800" />
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="lg:order-first lg:row-span-2">
						<h1 class="text-lg text-red-600">About Us</h1>
						<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-800 sm:text-5xl dark:text-zinc-100">Where Technology Meets Business Growth</h2>
						<div class="mt-6 space-y-7 text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
							<p>
								We're a team that sees technology clearly - its incredible potential and its hidden costs. In a world that keeps accelerating, where keeping up feels impossible and digital tools often demand more time than they save, we take a different approach.
							</p>
							<p>
								<span class="text-red-600 font-semibold">Our <u>mission</u></span>: <b>To harness technology that actually frees you</b>- systems that attract clients effortlessly, automate the tedious work, and create space for what matters most. No addictive algorithms, no complexity for complexity's sake. Just strategic solutions that help you focus on growth, creativity, and your real priorities.
							</p>
							<p>That's why at Sevinci, we bridge the gap between innovation and execution. We help businesses unlock efficiency, amplify their digital presence, and future-proof their operations through cutting-edge yet purposeful technology and strategic design.</p>
							
							<h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-100">Why Partner With Sevinci?</h3>
							<p>
								Because we know that feeling – the exhaustion of racing to stay relevant, the dread of falling behind, the frustration of tools that promise efficiency but demand constant babysitting. Technology partnerships shouldn’t add to that stress. They should be your safe harbor in the storm of digital change.
								
							</p>
							<p>
								We’re your allies in the trenches – a team that only succeeds when you do. When we build your website or automate your workflows, we’re not just delivering code; we’re giving you back the mental space to breathe, create, and focus on the work that lights you up. No bloated features, no tech for tech’s sake—just measurable results wrapped in intuitive design.
							</p>
							<p>
								This is what happens when technology finally shows up for you respecting your attention—helping you attract the right clients, systems that work while you sleep, and tools that adapt so you don’t have to constantly learn new ones. The future shouldn’t feel like a treadmill – let’s build one that moves at your pace.
							</p>
							

						</div>
						<ul role="list" class="mt-10">
