								<a class="group flex text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 transition hover:text-red-500 dark:text-zinc-200 dark:hover:text-red-500" href="#">
									<TwitterIcon />
									<span class="ml-4">Follow on X</span>
								</a>
							</li> -->
